### 1) List candidates
GET http://localhost:7070/api/candidates
Accept: application/json

### 2) Get a candidate by id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/candidates/1
Accept: application/json

### 3) Create a candidate
POST http://localhost:7070/api/candidates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo User",
  "phone": "44444444",
  "education": "Demo demo demo"
}

### 4) Update a candidate
PUT http://localhost:7070/api/candidates/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo User Updated",
  "phone": "44444445",
  "education": "Demo demo demo demo"
}

### 5) Link an existing skill to a candidate
PUT http://localhost:7070/api/candidates/1/skills/1
Accept: application/json

### 6) Delete a candidate
DELETE http://localhost:7070/api/candidates/4
Accept: application/json

### 7) List again (to verify changes)
GET http://localhost:7070/api/candidates
Accept: application/json